# ⚙️ DAX Measures & Data Modeling

## 📌 Overview

This document explains the DAX measures, calculated columns, relationships, and business logic used throughout the Maji Ndogo Public Transparency & Project Monitoring Dashboard.

The analytical solution was developed using **320,900 records across 9 interconnected datasets**, enabling project monitoring, cost analysis, accessibility tracking, and vendor performance evaluation.

