# 🧮 Calculated Columns

## 1. Budgeted Improvement Cost

```DAX
budgeted_improvement_cost =
IF(
    CONTAINSSTRING(
        'project_progress'[town],
        "Rural"
    ),
    RELATED('infrastructure_cost'[Rural_adjusted_cost]),
    RELATED('infrastructure_cost'[unit_cost_USD])
)
```

### Business Purpose

Assigns the appropriate budget value depending on project location type and serves as the foundation for budget monitoring and cost variance analysis.

---

## 2. Project Duration Days

```DAX
project_duration_days =
IF(
    NOT(ISBLANK('project_progress'[date_started]))
        && NOT(ISBLANK('project_progress'[date_of_completion])),
    DATEDIFF(
        'project_progress'[date_started],
        'project_progress'[date_of_completion],
        DAY
    ),
    BLANK()
)
```

### Business Purpose

Calculates delivery duration and supports Key Influencers and Top Segments analyses.

