# 📊 Project Progress Measures

## Total Improvements

```DAX
total_improvements =
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('project_progress'),
    ALLEXCEPT(
        'project_progress',
        'project_progress'[town]
    )
)
```

### Business Purpose

Counts all planned projects while preserving town context.

---

## Number of Completed Projects

```DAX
number_completed_projects =
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('project_progress'),
    'project_progress'[source_status] = "Complete"
)
```

### Business Purpose

Counts completed improvement projects.

### Validation Result

29 completed projects at launch.

---

## Project Completion Percentage

```DAX
pct_project_complete =
DIVIDE(
    [number_completed_projects],
    [total_improvements],
    0
)
```

### Business Purpose

Measures project completion progress across towns, provinces, and the national programme.

---

## Sources To Go

```DAX
sources_to_go =
[total_improvements] - [number_completed_projects]
```

### Business Purpose

Calculates remaining unfinished improvements.

