# 🌍 Water Accessibility Measures

## Total Population

```DAX
total_population =
SUM('water_source'[number_of_people_served])
```

### Business Purpose

Returns the population served in the current report context.

---

## Population With Existing Basic Access

```DAX
Population_With_Basic_Access =
CALCULATE(
    SUM('water_source'[number_of_people_served]),
    'water_source'[Basic_water_access] = "Basic Access"
)
```

### Business Purpose

Calculates people who already had access before programme implementation.

---

## Alternative Basic Access Measure

```DAX
population_with_basic_access_v2 =
CALCULATE(
    SUM('water_source'[number_of_people_served]),
    FILTER(
        ALL('water_source'),
        OR(
            OR(
                AND(
                    'water_source'[type_of_water_source] = "well",
                    RELATED('well_pollution'[results]) = "Clean"
                ),
                'water_source'[type_of_water_source] = "tap_in_home"
            ),
            AND(
                'water_source'[type_of_water_source] = "shared_tap",
                'water_source'[Average_queue_time] < 30
            )
        )
    )
)
```

### Business Purpose

Demonstrates an alternative measure-based approach for classifying basic water access.

---

## Population Newly Gaining Basic Access

```DAX
population_now_basic_access =
CALCULATE(
    SUM('water_source'[number_of_people_served]),
    'project_progress'[source_status] = "Complete"
)
```

### Business Purpose

Calculates people benefiting from completed projects.

### Validation Result

10,760 people (~11K).

---

## Percentage of Population With Basic Access

```DAX
pct_population_now_basic_access =
DIVIDE(
    [Population_With_Basic_Access]
        + [population_now_basic_access],
    [total_population],
    0
)
```

### Business Purpose

Measures population accessibility improvements over time.

| Stage | Result |
|---------|---------:|
| Launch | 34% |
| 2024 Update | 48% |
| Final Completion | 100% |

